-- =============================================================================
-- Migration 004: Food Catalogue Hardening
-- =============================================================================
-- NON-DESTRUCTIVE. Adds RPCs, triggers, indexes, and policy fixes.
-- Apply via Supabase Dashboard > SQL Editor.
